{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>酒店知識｜大家住酒店時有沒有遇過透明浴室？好好的浴室間隔偏偏換上透明大玻璃，洗澡、如廁一覽無遺。情侶間尚算情趣，但與親人或朋友入住真的超尷尬！有台灣網民以「透明浴室真的很有情趣嗎？」為題發問引起熱烈討論，最後更發現透明浴室背後5大功能！</p><p>😃Agoda X 《香港01》獨家優惠😃\n😍全球酒店免優惠碼額外減5%（經指定連結預訂）😍</p><p>👉follow 好食玩飛ig ✈️免費睇旅遊飲食攻略</p><figure><img alt=\"有網民好奇「透明浴室真的很有情趣嗎？」，更在論壇上發問。（Dcard截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210305/444539830739668992390815.jpeg/NCOBa3wP6nXs4tJlTQOH5SlDZ49yGBDQENLXyhDS18o\"/><figcaption>有網民好奇「透明浴室真的很有情趣嗎？」，更在論壇上發問。（Dcard截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>「透明浴室真的很有情趣嗎？」相信這也是不少人好奇的問題，有台灣網民早前在Dcard論壇就此發問，好奇情侶入住時會否對有「偷窺」功能的玻璃覺得有情趣，又指與家人出遊遇上透明浴室的旅館會變得很尷尬，質疑正經的旅館為何會變成這樣。</p><p>問題引起網民的熱烈討論，不少人分享各種爆笑的經歷和看法，甚至有人試過「大便時男友在玻璃外盯著看」的尷尬場面，點擊圖片睇睇網民討論 👇👇</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210305/444539421543370752927560.jpeg/V6HlGEyG-eutJOWfH59V363LGAu8SCNJxGp_bMRqf2w\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210305/444539423640653824625907.jpeg/yVrAIH5v4TAb1ms8u3N1sdTQZ3BDmtmcQsMTdkLDE3Y\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210305/444539425909903360084519.jpeg/uNoIz2GQUJmNGjTrcy3lBkX5WdpdI86rff49kn3-PZI\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210305/444539427860385792294367.jpeg/Bf5YQZ0KH18jOSvmMp68P-xd_cRSuh7NvLyXgby8l4E\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210305/444539430079303680790561.jpeg/jYWJzbw7xfTCns8TqScUi3oL4LxLne6gQOXP5EDlz-Q\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210305/444539432273055744908752.jpeg/_dRwRwgAA3imTZFkyp6ivEU3KoerSEsu7W5aF-1uWhc\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210305/444539434831712256674235.jpeg/hE_qk8ieYcGixoWX_8pS0pEzwINOIw5tRCjb9UQo2_U\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210305/444539437038047232914672.jpeg/_3Gnet_xn5H3g7Vq1Re5AoSSrWlVY8YMhtNruobTa7o\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210305/444539439202439168402691.jpeg/TLgjmLFGrGFfQF0a9C359Y_VQR_t4vuVI_rlliP65ZY\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210305/444539441794650112159270.jpeg/lxoq4I7PPWjka9pcwP760kSnAOTE6uDojO6h4YzuoeE\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210305/444539420972945408792584.jpeg/8jp_lQBPyABUIl_Zq_xlQ6JSgJf56P_6SN5IBEjeSAQ\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210305/444539423275749376936401.jpeg/Br4ONL4P7uw2Wci5rv47c-aQC59Q-ThL1ry7Cta8uwo\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210305/444539425763102720519376.jpeg/s9Fcw8YbHsBhDkLp5Un23t9Tb5zWPuveE5ft3ROX7d0\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210305/444539428258844672157940.jpeg/-pO75--F3v25393Y8JVeZ6YUvMnmWtitjB6fSowen0o\"/><p>透明浴室的功能當然不只增加情侶間的情趣，原來更重要是酒店或旅館本身的考量？想知原因，點擊圖片睇睇透明浴室5大功能 👇👇</p><figure><img alt=\"透明浴室5大功能\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210305/444539294665674752340896.jpeg/HaCH5SsT0j9e2nsSPKIa8INK2-DgJXi7wVDOcsFQznI\"/><figcaption>透明浴室5大功能</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"透明浴室5大功能\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210305/444539296788123648396107.jpeg/7EPGYEf2ikyLq5s8kLr8nm2shFfXa5FP2ox1f9qMdX8\"/><figcaption>透明浴室5大功能</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"透明浴室5大功能\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210305/444539299271282688172648.jpeg/FFZ5iu8dJTTJxOcNeAp53iIX3ucnXc0h-fdV6_n3Ves\"/><figcaption>透明浴室5大功能</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"透明浴室5大功能\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210305/444539301834133504657380.jpeg/DynxKj3eZ9VHsM5tKOD6vwB-4ti1a-xmCJVKWwiVSls\"/><figcaption>透明浴室5大功能</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"透明浴室5大功能\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210305/444539304250183680280635.jpeg/onTSUeJnurr1k2OKr8VUtBtZMQLxiZGlIqpabyKqWm8\"/><figcaption>透明浴室5大功能</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"透明浴室5大功能\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210305/444539306532016128154870.jpeg/-dD6pqOk788Sda1-Akd6KMEsB5tzgAJOjsAp-47AKfs\"/><figcaption>透明浴室5大功能</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"透明浴室5大功能\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210305/444539308708990976583942.jpeg/nHZr9LDix80zWibt9_XS38JWADEzItrKfktun35Lbp8\"/><figcaption>透明浴室5大功能</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"透明浴室5大功能\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210305/444539311762575360472801.jpeg/1XOoEm7qF-694Ekn6DDYdZNOXjk8gkqQIaBFpiGgRaY\"/><figcaption>透明浴室5大功能</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"透明浴室5大功能\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210305/444539314237345792826740.jpeg/d4NDUbWsIlWG5RuTGofztqBK-eZvEZqzcXHJ-XFxyfk\"/><figcaption>透明浴室5大功能</figcaption></figure><p>😱😱😱 同場加映：酒店房床頭射燈非閱讀燈？放4個枕頭有原因　床尾巾用途很貼心！ 😱😱😱</p><p>為了令住客有舒適的住宿體驗和良好印象，其實酒店房的用品擺放和設計等都經過設計，但許多用品的用途連住客都未必知道。以下所整理6件用品的設計用途你又知幾多？點擊圖片挑戰一下 👇👇</p><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200626/353235642236407809.jpeg/6JFgGzBT3oEYnf2b_cs4OwLrViXyAyl6LsR82y7EfNs\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200626/353235644392280064.jpeg/m0sIwGnpxOrj4apLih1NMVVIAk3PEZ5zr83Ofa_Nzn0\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200626/353235646409740288.jpeg/U75czGyNw9FN1euyVk3jfaiSo1Ev1iCkMI0JejCNCXo\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200626/353235648775327745.jpeg/vslKgv5HRX7zmjaGhtJWxZR4kN0HWKMFPN1GIDzdRiA\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200626/353235651094777856.jpeg/sbiGLcCxjeKoaKuH0Ro1oVspjWB6r7gnJdyryiXcq8o\"/><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200626/353235653607165952.jpeg/iO8xLtvgqpj1KlQWkHLjoi2MHxMYgRk7_t1CEv7dQhI\"/><p>床尾巾到底有無實際作用？立即點擊睇全文了解 👉👉 酒店房床頭射燈非閱讀燈？放4個枕頭有原因　床尾巾用途很貼心！</p><p>（全文完）👉follow 好食玩飛ig ✈️免費睇旅遊飲食攻略</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-07T05:19:30.882793+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":771,"images":30,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}